WEBVTT

00:00:16.098 --> 00:00:17.225
(SCREAMS)

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:20.019
Are you wearing a Speedo, Eddie?

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:21.395
What are you...

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:23.689
EDDIE'S MOTHER:
Eddie, is everything all right?

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:26.275
Yeah, uh, just doing my laps, Ma!

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:28.194
(VIDEO GAME MUSIC PLAYING ON TV)

00:00:28.277 --> 00:00:30.947
So, what, you live in the pool house now?

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.242
Yeah, my folks want me to be more, you know,

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.910
independent, I guess.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.621
They even hooked me up
with this life coach dude.

00:00:38.704 --> 00:00:40.665
-Life coach?
-Yeah.

00:00:40.748 --> 00:00:43.167
I guess he's gonna help me
find my purpose in life.

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:44.293
I thought I had one,

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:47.964
but, turns out, it wasn't
the right one or something?

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.090
I don't know.

00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:52.343
Anyway, he's got me
on this whole schedule thing.

00:00:52.426 --> 00:00:54.262
It's like, Mondays, take out the recycling.

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:56.931
Tuesdays, mow the lawn.
Wednesdays, go visit Nana.

00:00:57.014 --> 00:00:58.140
Thursdays, clean the pool.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.226
It's like, don't we have people
to do all this stuff?

00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:02.103
Whoa, whoa. Back up.

00:01:02.186 --> 00:01:03.855
Your nana is still alive?

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:05.022
Oh, yeah.

00:01:10.152 --> 00:01:11.237
Wow.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.405
And she's rich, right?

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:13.739
She's loaded.

00:01:13.823 --> 00:01:17.201
But trust me,
you don't wanna go near my nana.

00:01:17.285 --> 00:01:18.536
(SHUDDERS)

00:01:18.619 --> 00:01:20.454
She is one mean sheep.

00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:30.423
(SINGING SWING SONG)

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:36.178
Now fade up the spot.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.142
Good. Lower the moon.

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:42.643
-Coffee?
-Thank you, Miss Crawly.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.395
(CABLES CREAK)

00:01:44.478 --> 00:01:47.815
Okay, that's normal. Just needs a knock.

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:50.026
See? You're getting it.

00:01:55.865 --> 00:01:57.575
Anyone seen my glass eye?

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.244
The darn thing keeps popping out.

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:04.832
Whoa!

00:02:08.085 --> 00:02:09.086
Oh!

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:12.423
You almost killed me, Jumbo!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:13.591
It wasn't me.

00:02:13.758 --> 00:02:15.092
-Oh, is that so?
-(FIRE ROARS)

00:02:15.217 --> 00:02:16.719
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.388
Pete? (GASPS)

00:02:19.513 --> 00:02:20.598
(GROANS)

00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:22.558
(GROANING)

00:02:23.392 --> 00:02:25.269
Pete, you're gonna be all right, okay?

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:26.812
Just hang in there, buddy.

00:02:26.979 --> 00:02:28.731
(INDISTINCT ARGUING)

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:30.900
-Ricki? Kai?
-(CRYING)

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:32.401
Why aren't you guys rehearsing?

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.736
We're through!

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:36.238
They said I'm an intolerable egomaniac.

00:02:36.739 --> 00:02:39.367
I don't even know what that means!

00:02:41.118 --> 00:02:43.037
All right. We're two acts down.

00:02:43.204 --> 00:02:45.164
Give me some good news, Miss Crawly.

00:02:45.456 --> 00:02:47.667
Oh, it's not as bad as it looks.

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.171
-Oopsie-daisy.
-(SIGHS)

00:02:52.254 --> 00:02:54.215
Meena, how would you like
to re-audition for the show?

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.717
Really? Well, yeah.

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:58.010
-Great!
-I mean, no.

00:02:58.094 --> 00:02:59.095
What?

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.097
I mean, yes, I can sing.

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.767
But, no, I get so nervous and I can't do it.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.103
I mean, I would totally do it, but...

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:08.604
(STAMMERS) No, I... No.

00:03:09.397 --> 00:03:10.773
I'm gonna take that as a maybe.

00:03:11.774 --> 00:03:12.775
-(GIGGLING)
-(JAPANESE SONG PLAYING)

00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:14.443
Great! Look, they're back!

00:03:14.568 --> 00:03:16.153
We're gonna come back to this, Meena.

00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:17.947
-(POP MUSIC PLAYING)
-(MUSIC STOPS)

00:03:18.572 --> 00:03:20.241
Listen, guys, forget what I said before.

00:03:20.324 --> 00:03:22.326
You are very talented.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.161
Please, join the show. Okay?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.497
Yes? No?

00:03:26.914 --> 00:03:28.374
Oh, um...

00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:29.917
Here...

00:03:30.084 --> 00:03:32.294
(SPEAKING JAPANESE)

00:03:38.175 --> 00:03:39.176
(ALL GASP)

00:03:40.261 --> 00:03:43.431
What? Hey, no! Wait, wait, wait! Don't go!

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:47.601
(DANCE MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:47.685 --> 00:03:48.853
Oh. What is this for?

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.605
Now, we use this to follow the steps.

00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:53.733
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:04:02.199 --> 00:04:03.617
(CASPAR YELLING)

00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:05.286
Caspar! Caspar! No!

00:04:05.369 --> 00:04:06.620
How about this? Ha-ha!

00:04:06.787 --> 00:04:08.080
Come on! What did I tell you?

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:11.625
I'm so sorry, he had a fever
and it was too late to get a sitter, so...

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:13.377
-Well, you seem fine now!
-(CASPAR GIGGLING AND SHOUTING)

00:04:13.461 --> 00:04:14.545
Wow!

00:04:14.628 --> 00:04:16.505
(SINGING OFF-KEY)

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:18.215
Stop! You're messing it up!

00:04:18.299 --> 00:04:19.467
Hey!

00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:20.676
(POP MUSIC PLAYING ON STEREO)

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.887
I am not singing this.

00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:24.096
What's not to like?

00:04:24.221 --> 00:04:25.890
You're a female and you're a teenager.

00:04:25.973 --> 00:04:27.099
This song was made for you.

00:04:27.391 --> 00:04:29.310
(SARCASTICALLY) Wow.
It's like you can see inside

00:04:29.393 --> 00:04:30.644
my tiny teenage mind.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:31.896
I know, right?

00:04:31.979 --> 00:04:34.982
You just gotta add some moves
and a little bit of...

00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:37.359
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:43.783
Go for it!

00:04:43.949 --> 00:04:45.493
Oh, you mean like this?

00:04:45.576 --> 00:04:48.704
(SINGING)

00:04:50.915 --> 00:04:53.000
There you go! You're a natural!

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:55.002
(PLAYING PIANO)

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.755
(PLAYS OFF-KEY)

00:04:57.963 --> 00:04:59.215
(FRUSTRATED GROAN)

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.509
Yes, that was very bad.

00:05:01.675 --> 00:05:02.802
BIG DADDY: (OVER RADIO) Johnny?

00:05:03.427 --> 00:05:04.512
Come in. Over.

00:05:04.678 --> 00:05:06.263
Oh, Johnny, your jacket's talking.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:07.932
Johnny, where are you?

00:05:08.099 --> 00:05:09.892
Dad, what's going on? Over.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.186
What do you mean you gotta leave now?

00:05:12.269 --> 00:05:13.896
I know. I'm so sorry.

00:05:13.979 --> 00:05:15.356
It's just that I've got
this family business thing.

00:05:15.439 --> 00:05:18.067
Do I need to start worrying about
your commitment here, Johnny?

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.819
-Tell me no.
-No. Absolutely not.

00:05:19.902 --> 00:05:20.861
I promise it won't happen again.

00:05:20.945 --> 00:05:22.696
-It better not.
-Thank you, Mr. Moon.

00:05:24.198 --> 00:05:25.199
(SIGHS)

00:05:25.866 --> 00:05:27.409
Baby, I'm back.

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:28.702
(SINGING AND MUSIC FROM INSIDE)

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:36.335
(SINGING ROCK SONG)

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:38.337
ASH: What is going on here?

00:05:40.714 --> 00:05:42.883
Hi, I'm Becky.

00:05:43.175 --> 00:05:44.301
Becky?

00:05:44.885 --> 00:05:47.555
Hey, what did you expect?
You're never around anymore.

00:05:47.638 --> 00:05:50.057
I did it for us, Lance!

00:05:50.224 --> 00:05:51.225
You and me!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.393
(YELPS)

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:54.103
Oh, sweetie, I'm sorry.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.272
I think I left my sunglasses in there.

00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:58.440
(PANTING)

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.652
LANCE: Come on, Becky.
Let's get out of here.

00:06:01.735 --> 00:06:02.736
(SIGHS)

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:05.197
(CLUB MUSIC PLAYING)

